'''Bloom''' is an [[Effects|effect]] that was obtainable by purchasing the [[Bloom Bundle]] for 3,399 Robux in the [[Easter Event 2025]].

== Appearance ==
When this effect is equipped, the player’s knife emits a pastel pink aura and pink flowers that fall around the weapon. Petals and other fragments emitted from flowers scattered and can sometimes be seen trailing behind the player.

== Trivia ==
* This is the only item within the [[Bloom Bundle]] that can not be purchased from a separate gamepass.
* When the [[Bloom Bundle]] came out originally the effect did not have a death effect. This was later confirmed to be a bug and was fixed.

